$ akb agent list
* claude-code  Claude Code
    claude -p --dangerously-skip-permissions
    takes: provider, baseUrl, apiKey (key), model, reasoning, args
  codex        Codex
    codex exec --json --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox
    takes: provider, baseUrl, apiKey (key), model, reasoning, args
    lacks: early-crash resume; rate-limit exit
  cursor       Cursor
    cursor-agent -p --output-format stream-json --force
    takes: model, apiKey (key), args
    lacks: early-crash resume; run cost; token counts; context window; rate-limit exit; provider retry; direct skill call
  opencode     OpenCode
    opencode run --format json
    takes: model, variant, args
    lacks: rate-limit exit; provider retry; direct skill call
  kimi         Kimi Code
    kimi --output-format stream-json
    takes: provider, model, modelName, protocol, baseUrl, apiKey (key), args
    lacks: early-crash resume; run cost; rate-limit exit; provider retry; direct skill call; pasted pictures
  dsh          DSH
    dsh-acp --permission-mode workspace-write
    takes: model, apiKey (key), args
    lacks: context window; rate-limit exit; provider retry; direct skill call; pasted pictures
  zcode        ZCode
    zcode app-server
    takes: model, apiKey (key), args
    lacks: early-crash resume; run cost; rate-limit exit; provider retry; direct skill call; pasted pictures
  grok         Grok Build
    grok agent --always-approve stdio
    takes: model, apiKey (key), args
    lacks: context window; rate-limit exit; provider retry; direct skill call; pasted pictures

The one marked * is what Global default runs. Move it with `akb agent use <name>`.

